### Scenario 3: Test All Overloads
# Verify all PdfHelper method overloads work correctly

### Overload 1: RenderPdfPageAsync(string pdfPath, int pageIndex, int targetDpi)
POST {{OCREngine_HostAddress}}/api/test/pdf/render-page
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< {{pdfFile}}
--boundary123--

### Overload 2: RenderPdfPageAsync(Stream pdfStream, int pageIndex, int targetDpi)
POST {{OCREngine_HostAddress}}/api/test/pdf/render-from-stream
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< {{pdfFile}}
--boundary123--

